  2505	  # .gitignore entry — additive, idempotent. PLAN-177 W1 (CF-9): the text and
  2506	  # the create-or-append logic live in the ONE generator in
  2507	  # _framework_manifest_set.sh, because upgrade.sh now delivers the same block
  2508	  # (an adopter older than v1.2.0 never received it from an upgrade). INV-4 /
  2509	  # PLAN-168 W2: two copies of one emitted text is the class that produced the
  2510	  # PROTOCOL.md pointer divergence, so a missing generator is a broken checkout
