  3066	# PRESERVE/REFUSE customizations instead of clobbering them (incl. the root
  3067	# PROTOCOL.md — the verified S238 driver). The enumeration is the SINGLE shared
  3068	# set from _framework_manifest_set.sh, so the manifest writer (here) and the
  3069	# upgrade classifier walk an identical list.
  3070	#
  3071	# Manifest grammar (two record kinds):
  3072	#   <64hex>  <relpath>            — content hash of a copied file
  3073	#   LINK  <relpath>  <target>     — a --mode link symlink (content == source,
  3074	#                                   so a content hash is meaningless; the
  3075	#                                   upgrade classifier short-circuits LINK)
  3076	#
