   977	  || bad "S.10f a malformed digest field was returned as a digest"
   978	
   979	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   980	# S.11 (rail round-5 F1) — a WELL-FORMED hostile table.
   981	#
   982	# Rounds 1-4 hardened what a row may SAY: no `..`, no absolute path, no glob,
   983	# no unterminated undercount. Round 5 supplied a table that breaks NONE of
   984	# those rules and still drives an arbitrary write:
   985	#
