   277	    """Parse the shared delivery-route table.
   278	
   279	    Fail-CLOSED by design (CLAUDE.md §4: fail-open on infrastructure,
   280	    fail-closed on INPUT). This table decides which source each destination
   281	    is compared against, so a table we cannot parse is not a degraded read —
   282	    it is exactly the D2 misclassification this wave cures, arriving
