   247	# ALL of them — the upgrade posture, where every enumerated file must record
   248	# what the framework SHIPS. install.sh needs the opposite default for most of
   249	# the tree: it RENDERS templates (`.claude/team.md`, skills, `{{X}}`
   250	# placeholders under --project et al), so those legitimately differ from
